  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanda One UN Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In January 2007, Rwanda was selected as one of eight pilot countries for the UN reform process known as Delivering as One (DaO). The objective of this One UN pilot was to enable the UN System to provide a more effective and coherent response to the needs of the Government of Rwanda and its Development Partners.</narrative>
  </description>
